  "method": "Serial in-process HTTP against a Windows TestClient. Fresh-process samples reopen the saved checkpoint and optionally perform one current or pinned read; startup and import are excluded. Warm samples compare step/rewind/current/explicit save/pinned reads and separate legacy CRT detail plus SMT requests on the same pinned market. Save samples repeat explicit save of the same ID. OS page cache is uncontrolled.",
